OL,3,GNEWSAStar Trek stars lead tributes to
OL,4,A'magnificent actor' Sir Patrick Stewart
OL,5,Aafter his death aged 86
OL,6,
OL,7,FLegendary Star Trek actor Sir Patrick
OL,8,FStewart has died aged 86
OL,10,FHis co-stars have led tributes, with
OL,11,FWilliam Shatner saying that Stewart
OL,12,F"stood for the best of us" and George
OL,13,FTakei calling him an "irreplaceable
OL,14,Flegend"
OL,16,FMeanwhile, fellow X-Men actor Hugh
OL,17,FJackman says "we lost one of the greats
OL,18,Fof stage and screen"
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
